# Build context for BOTH images is the REPOSITORY ROOT — the server and the frontend
# both reference projects under external/dotnet-sdk (the NArk SDK submodule), so a
# context narrowed to src/ would restore-fail with MSB3202. Keep external/ included.

# ── Secrets: never let these reach a build layer ────────────────────────────
# .env holds Chain__NArk__TreasuryMnemonic — the seed phrase controlling the treasury
# wallet, which holds REAL bitcoin on mainnet. docker compose reads .env from the HOST
# and injects it as an environment variable at RUN time; the build must never see it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/

# ── VCS / tooling ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .git is excluded deliberately. It is unusable here anyway: in a git worktree and in a
# submodule, .git is a FILE pointing outside the context. Nerdbank.GitVersioning (used by
# the NArk SDK projects) falls back to its version.json base version without it, which is
# fine for a container build — the image is tagged from the CI commit SHA, not from NBGV.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

# ── Not needed to build or run the game ─────────────────────────────────────
docs/
# …EXCEPT the Terms of Use. ArkadeHeroes.Web.csproj bundles docs/TERMS.md into the WASM
# bundle as wwwroot/terms.md so the browser can render the acceptance gate and /terms
# without leaving the app. Excluding it builds fine (the Content item is Condition'd on
# the file existing) but silently ships a frontend whose terms screen has no prose —
# which matters precisely when Game__RequireTermsAcceptance is on.
!docs/TERMS.md
# Superpowers specs/plans are working-tree-only and must never be published anywhere.
docs/superpowers/
regtest/
contracts/
tests/
external/dotnet-sdk/docs/
external/dotnet-sdk/samples/
external/dotnet-sdk/api/
**/node_modules/

# ── Local state that must never be baked into an image ──────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
arkade-heroes-chain*.db*
arkade-design-time.db*

# ── Docker's own files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
